      "thinking": "Agreed, with the condition that deploys only happen from a commit that's passed the full suite. I'm switching to batched gating now\u2014quick checks at merge time, a full suite every ~2 hours with bisection if red, and deploys only from a green batched tip\u2014with the first batch running around 13:00.\n\n",
